L9: # Title:nnMIL: A generalizable multiple instance learning framework for computational pathology
L10: 
L11: Authors:cite6†Xiangde Luo , cite7†Jinxi Xiang , cite8†Yuanfeng Ji , cite9†Ruijiang Li L12: 
